<title>POLAND: Polish food prices rise 0.6 pct in May 1-10.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices rise 0.6 pct in May 1-10.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices rose 0.6 percent in the May 1-10 period after rising 0.3 percent in the previous 10 days. They were 1.1 percent higher than in the April 1-10 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.  </p>
<p>				    MAY 1-10  APRIL 20-30  LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)	0.6	   0.3	  1.1 (1.3)</p>
<p> Bread				0.5	   0.1	  0.6 (0.5)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	   3.8	   1.0	  5.9 (7.1)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.3	   0.2	  0.6 (0.5)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.5	   0.4	  1.3 (1.5)</p>
<p> Eggs				-3.5	   0.0	 -4.6 (-1.7)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on April 30.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
